WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.386
Here is how JobCairn helps you apply well.

00:00:05.317 --> 00:00:08.022
Claude tailors your resume and cover letter to

00:00:08.062 --> 00:00:08.489
the ad.

00:00:08.529 --> 00:00:11.456
Every line traces back to your own history.

00:00:12.399 --> 00:00:14.218
Edit it with a live preview.

00:00:14.258 --> 00:00:16.798
Pick a template in Resume Studio.

00:00:17.939 --> 00:00:20.098
Export a PDF or a Word file when

00:00:20.138 --> 00:00:21.366
it is ready.

00:00:22.304 --> 00:00:24.442
Nothing is sent without your OK.

00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:27.661
Emails and applications wait in Approvals.

00:00:29.319 --> 00:00:30.028
JobCairn.

00:00:30.068 --> 00:00:31.301
Apply with care,

00:00:31.341 --> 00:00:32.679
not in bulk.

